{"seq":1,"slug":"solar-energy","title":"太阳能技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"photovoltaic-fundamentals","title":"光伏发电原理与产业链","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/photovoltaic-fundamentals","wordCount":1832,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"perovskite-tandem-cells","title":"钙钛矿与叠层电池技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/perovskite-tandem-cells","wordCount":1760,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"concentrated-solar-storage","title":"聚光太阳能与光热储能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/solar-energy/concentrated-solar-storage","wordCount":1788,"readingTime":8}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"太阳能技术\">太阳能技术</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>太阳能是当前全球装机增长最快的清洁能源。本章从晶硅光伏的工作原理与产业链出发，进入钙钛矿等新型电池材料的前沿突破，最后覆盖聚光太阳能（CSP）的热储能应用场景。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>光伏发电原理与产业链</td>\n<td>晶硅/薄膜电池工作原理、制造流程、效率极限、LCOE演进</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>钙钛矿与叠层电池</td>\n<td>钙钛矿材料特性、稳定性挑战、叠层结构效率突破、商业化时间线</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>聚光太阳能与光热储能</td>\n<td>CSP塔式/槽式技术、熔盐储热、与光伏互补的调度优势</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>LCOE（平准化度电成本）</strong>：衡量发电技术经济竞争力的核心指标</li>\n<li><strong>Shockley-Queisser 极限</strong>：单结太阳电池理论效率上限（~33.7%）</li>\n<li><strong>钙钛矿（Perovskite）</strong>：ABX₃晶体结构的半导体材料，光电转换性能优异</li>\n</ul>\n"}